# Keeps both deployment/docker/Dockerfile.* build contexts small — both
# build from the repo root so `server/`, `shared/`, `alembic/`, and
# `frontend/` are all in context together. Neither Dockerfile uses a
# wildcard `COPY . .`, so this only affects context-transfer speed, not
# what ends up in an image layer — kept deliberately conservative so it
# never excludes a path either Dockerfile explicitly COPYs.

.git
.github

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
htmlcov

.venv
venv

frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/coverage

.env
.env.*
